hadiths[17]{hadithnumber,text}:
"84","Abdullah bin Saleh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Laith ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne mujhe likh bheja, apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Abu Bakr raziyallahu anhu ne ek din kaha: Allah ki qasam zameen ke chehre par Umar se zyada mehboob mere nazdeek koi shakhs nahi, phir jab woh bahar gaye to wapas aaye to unhon ne kaha: Aye meri beti maine kis tarah qasam khai thi, to maine un se kaha, to unhon ne kaha: Woh mujh par zyada aziz hain, aur aulad dil se zyada lagi hui hoti hai."
"85","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mahdi bin Maimun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Yaqub ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Num se, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Umar ke paas maujood tha jab ek shakhs ne un se machchhar ke khoon ke bare mein sawal kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Tum kahan se ho, to us ne kaha: Ahl-e-Iraq mein se hun, to unhon ne kaha: Is shakhs ko dekho, mujh se machchhar ke khoon ke bare mein sawal karta hai halanke unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke betay ko qatl kiya, maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Woh dono duniya mein mere do phool hain."
"86","Abul Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Adi bin Thabit se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Bara ko kehte hue suna: Maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko dekha aur Hasan salawatullahi alaihi aap ke kandhe par thay, aur aap farma rahe thay: Aye Allah beshak main is se mohabbat karta hun pas Tu is se mohabbat farma."
"87","Bishr bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Safwan bin Amr ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Jubair bin Nufair ne mujh se bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ek din Miqdad bin al-Aswad ke paas baithe hue thay, to ek shakhs un ke paas se guzra to us ne kaha: Khushkhabri ho un do aankhon ke liye jinhon ne Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko dekha, Allah ki qasam hum chahte thay ke hum dekhte jo tum ne dekha aur hum hazir hote jahan tum hazir hue, to woh ghussa ho gaye, to main hairan hone laga, us ne khair ke siwa kuch nahi kaha tha, phir woh us ki taraf mutawajjih hue to unhon ne kaha: Insan ko kya cheez ubharti hai ke woh aisi hazri ki tamanna kare jisse Allah ne use ghaib rakha, woh nahi janta ke agar woh us mein hazir hota to us mein us ka haal kaisa hota, Allah ki qasam Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aisi qaumein hazir huin jinhain Allah ne un ke naakon ke bal jahannam mein aundha kar diya, unhon ne aap ko jawab na diya aur na aap ki tasdeeq ki, kya tum Allah azza wa jalla ka shukr ada nahi karte jab ke us ne tumhein is haal mein nikala ke tum sirf apne Rab ko pehchante ho, pas tum tasdeeq karte ho us ki jo tumhare Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam lekar aaye, tum se ghairon ke zariye aazmaish ka kaam le liya gaya, Allah ki qasam Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam sab se sakht haal mein mabous hue jis mein kabhi koi Nabi mabous hua, aise fatrat aur jahiliyyat mein, woh nahi samajhte thay ke buton ki ibadat se behtar koi deen hai, pas aap furqan lekar aaye jis ke zariye aap ne haq aur batil ke darmiyan farq kiya, aur us ke zariye walid aur us ke betay ke darmiyan farq kiya, yahan tak ke beshak aadmi apne walid ya apne betay ya apne bhai ko kafir dekhta tha halanke Allah ne iman ke zariye us ke dil ka taala khol diya tha, aur woh janta hai ke agar woh halak hua to aag mein dakhil hoga, pas us ki aankh thandi nahi hoti jabke woh janta hai ke us ka mehboob aag mein hai, aur wohi hai jo Allah azza wa jalla ne farmaya: Aur woh jo kehte hain aye hamare Rab hamein hamari biwiyon aur hamari aulad se aankhon ki thandak ata farma."
"88","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin al-Mughira ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, unhon ne Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Main ek din Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas gaya, aur aap ke paas mere aur meri walida aur meri khala Umm-e-Haram ke siwa koi na tha, jab aap hamare paas tashreef laye to hum se farmaya: Kya main tumhein namaz na parhaun, aur woh namaz ke waqt ke baghair tha, to qaum mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: To unhon ne Anas ko apni nisbat kidhar kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne use apne daayein taraf kiya, phir unhon ne hamein namaz parhai, phir hum Ahl-e-Bait ke liye duniya aur aakhirat ki har bhalai ki dua ki, to meri walida ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasul aap ka chhota khadim hai, Allah se us ke liye dua farmaiye, to unhon ne mere liye har bhalai ki dua ki, un ki dua ke aakhir mein tha ke unhon ne farmaya: Aye Allah us ke maal aur us ki aulad ko zyada farma aur use us mein barkat ata farma."
"89","Muslim bin Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Fadala ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bakr bin Abdullah Muzani ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas bin Malik se ke ek aurat Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha ke paas aayi, to Aisha ne use teen khajoorein din, to us ne apne har bachche ko ek khajoor di aur apne liye ek khajoor rok li, to bachchon ne do khajoorein kha lin aur apni walida ki taraf dekha, to woh khajoor ki taraf lapki to use cheer diya, to har bachche ko aadhi khajoor di, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam tashreef laye to Aisha ne aap ko khabar di to aap ne farmaya: Tumhein is baat par kya taajjub hai, yaqeenan Allah ne us par us ke do bachchon par reham karne ki wajah se reham farmaya."
"90","Muhammad bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham se, unhon ne Urwa se, unhon ne Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Ek dehati Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya to us ne kaha: Kya tum apne bachchon ko bosa dete ho, hum to unhein bosa nahi dete, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Agar Allah ne tumhare dil se rehmat nikal li hai to main tumhare liye kya ikhtiyar rakhta hun."
"91","Abul Yaman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuaib ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salama bin Abdur Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya ke Hazrat Abu Huraira ne farmaya: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Hasan bin Ali ko bosa diya aur aap ke paas Aqra bin Habis Tamimi baitha hua tha, to Aqra ne kaha: Mere das bachche hain maine un mein se kisi ko bosa nahi diya, to Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us ki taraf dekha phir farmaya: Jo reham nahi karta us par reham nahi kiya jata."
"92","Muhammad bin Abdul Aziz ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Walid bin Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, Walid bin Numair bin Aus se, unhon ne apne walid ko kehte hue suna: Woh kaha karte thay: Salahiyat Allah ki taraf se hai aur adab baapon ki taraf se hai."
"93","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Ala bin Abdul Ala Quraishi ne hamein khabar di, Dawud bin Abi Hind se, unhon ne Amir se ke Numan bin Bashir ne un se bayan kiya ke un ke walid unhein uthaye hue Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas le gaye to unhon ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasul beshak main aap ko gawah banata hun ke maine Numan ko itna itna atiya kar diya hai, to aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne apne har betay ko atiya diya hai, unhon ne kaha: Nahi, unhon ne farmaya: To mere siwa kisi aur ko gawah banao, phir farmaya: Kya tumhein ye khush nahi karta ke woh neki mein barabar hon, unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahi, unhon ne farmaya: To phir aisa na karo."
"94","Ibn Makhlad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Isa bin Yunus se, unhon ne Wassafi se, unhon ne Muharib bin Dithar se, unhon ne Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Allah ne unhein abrar is liye naam diya kyunke unhon ne baapon aur beton se neki ki, jis tarah tumhare walid ka tum par haq hai isi tarah tumhare betay ka tum par haq hai."
"95","Muhammad bin al-Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muawiya bin Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Shaiban se, unhon ne Firas se, unhon ne Atiyya se, unhon ne Abu Saeed se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Jo reham nahi karta us par reham nahi kiya jata."
"96","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Muawiya ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Aamash se, unhon ne Zaid bin Wahb se aur Abu Zabyan se, unhon ne Jareer bin Abdullah se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Allah us par rehem nahi karta jo logon par rehem nahi karta."
"97","Aur Abda se, unhon ne Ibn Abi Khalid se, unhon ne Qais se, unhon ne Jareer bin Abdullah se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jo logon par rehem nahi karta Allah us par rehem nahi karta."
"98","Aur Abda se, unhon ne Hisham se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se riwayat kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aarabiyon me se kuch log aaye, to un me se ek shakhs ne Aap se kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, kya aap bachchon ko chumte hain, pas Allah ki qasam hum to unhein nahi chumte, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Agar Allah azza wa jalla ne tumhare dil se rehmat nikaal li hai to phir main kya ikhtiyar rakhta hun."
"99","Abu al-Numan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Aasim se, unhon ne Abu Usman se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Umar raziyallahu anhu ne ek shakhs ko aamil muqarrar kiya, to aamil ne kaha: Mere itne itne bache hain, maine un me se kisi ek ko bhi nahi chuma, to Umar ne gumaan zahir kiya ya Umar ne kaha: Beshak Allah azza wa jalla apne bandon me se sirf intehai nekon par hi rehem karta hai."
"100","Al-Hakam bin Nafe ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuayb ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Saeed bin al-Musayyib ne humein khabar di ke Hazrat Abu Huraira ne kaha: Maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah azza wa jalla ne rehmat ko sau hisson me banaya, phir apne paas nanve hisse rok rakhe aur zameen me ek hissa utara, to usi ek hisse se makhlooq aapas me ek dusre par rehem karti hai, yahan tak ke ghodi apne bache se apna khur upar utha leti hai is khauf se ke kahin use lag na jaye."
